[TITLE]
NUM-58: 1000-ac impervious subcatchment with no depression storage gets a drizzle
of 0.0005 in/hr for 10 h at 10 mg/L (wet deposition). Runoff stays below
MIN_RUNOFF (0.001 in/hr) but is routed to J1; its pollutant (10 mg/L, the
rain concentration, as nothing else adds or removes pollutant) must go with it.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         60
REPORT_STEP          01:00:00

